OL,3,GNEWSAVictim in murder probe named by   
OL,4,Apolice                                 
OL,6,FA woman who was found dead in a        
OL,7,Fproperty in Wisbech has been named by  
OL,8,Fpolice as Vera Jaunzeme.               
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was      
OL,11,Fcalled to Alexandra Road, Wisbech, at  
OL,12,Fabout 21:50 GMT on Saturday, to reports
OL,13,Fthat the body of the 61-year-old had   
OL,14,Fbeen discovered.                       
OL,16,FThe force said a 62-year-old man was   
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of murder and    
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital where he remained.   
OL,19,FPolice said he would be taken into     
OL,20,Fcustody on his discharge.              
